 write buffer | customer and dates | same Units: 2 Units Pruned: 99
 write buffer | customer range     | same Units: 3 Units Pruned: 98
 write buffer | customer list      | same Units: 4 Units Pruned: 97
 write buffer | other column       | same Units: 37 Units Pruned: 64
 write buffer | top-N by key       | same Units: 10 Units Pruned: 0
(6 rows)

